//
// Key hypothesis: The validTokenGroups might be empty or not contain the right schema tokens.
// If validTokenGroups is empty, GroupBoostedConstrainedStep degrades to ConstrainedStep.
// The boost of 6.0 on empty groups does nothing.
//
// Better approach: Use ConstrainedStep directly (since GroupBoostedConstrainedStep without
// relevant groups is equivalent). The semantic errors might not be fixable via token-level
