// meaning the evaluator found a valid span but it's not the "final" answer span.
// This might mean the SQL content is being extracted but the evaluator is calling it non-final.
// Or it means: the valid span is present but the extraction source is text_fallback.
//
// Given all 300 have extracted answers (none 0/300), the extraction is working.
// The 49.7% accuracy is purely semantic model quality.
//
